cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "saxsnmr: a validation harness for simulated SAXS, SANS and NMR observables"
abstract: >-
  Fetches experimental SAXS curves and NMR chemical shifts for a protein,
  runs short implicit-solvent molecular dynamics from a matched structure,
  and reports how well the simulated observables reproduce the measured
  ones. Includes a dependency-free SAXS calculator, a neutron forward
  model, and controls that make an agreement figure interpretable.
type: software
authors:
